Cell["\<\
A radius-zero ball contains only its centre and does not resolve a dimension. \
A useful scale window requires many hops inside the region and enough room \
before the graph boundary. The lattice calculation proves a volume limit; the \
sampled example illustrates it under a different construction. Neither \
establishes a continuum limit for an arbitrary graph family.\
\>", "Text",
 CellDingbat->None,ExpressionUUID->"6911835e-25fb-48ce-9770-c862c43d57a4"],

